  "modifications": "Upstream files byte-exact; EHCI and psmouse function extractions exact; compatibility and OS bridge separate GPL-2.0-or-later sources",
  "scope": "Complete original Linux Boot mouse/keyboard, urb.c, libps2.c; complete EHCI qtd_fill and psmouse standard/extended packet and IntelliMouse/Explorer detection function extractions. Not full Linux HCD/core/hub/generic HID/i8042/atkbd/psmouse drivers. Complete original core/config.c descriptor/configuration/BOS parser; native enumeration and HCD remain. Complete hid-core parser/field/collection, signed-value, resolution multiplier and open/close report function extractions; not full hid-core bus/input event dispatch or hid-generic driver. Complete unchanged hid-input.c and hid-generic.c with host-executed bounded native transport/input services; native USB endpoints do not call generic report/event dispatch yet. No Linux HCD or complete USB core/hub.",
